               s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 t3 t4 t5 t6) F (Z_to_bv 64 0x24068) fc None m (seg_rom usegs)).
Proof. try (pose proof ceil_window_holds as CEIL_RANGE__).
